+"""Isolated real-SSH/HTTPS widget smoke; run only the test-relay collector binary.
+
+sudo python3 linux/tests/widget_statistics_smoke.py --collector /absolute/path/to/agentspeed-collector-ssh-smoke --evidence /tmp/widget-smoke-evidence.json
